{
  "_id": "tg-servant",
  "content": [
    {
      "text": "Cursed be Canaan; a servant of servants shall he be, Gen. 9:25. Israel … believed the Lord, and his servant Moses, Ex. 14:31. children of Israel are servants; they are my servants, Lev. 25:55. remember that thou wast a servant in … Egypt, Deut. 5:15. Speak; for thy servant heareth, 1 Sam. 3:10. If thou wilt be a servant, 1 Kgs. 12:7. Moses the servant of God, 1 Chr. 6:49. Hast thou considered my servant Job, Job 1:8. fool shall be servant to the wise of heart, Prov. 11:29. wise servant shall have rule over a son, Prov. 17:2. borrower is servant to the lender, Prov. 22:7. my servant, whom I uphold, Isa. 42:1 (Matt. 12:18). hear, O Jacob my servant, Isa. 44:1 (1 Ne. 20:20). Thou art my servant, O Israel, Isa. 49:3 (1 Ne. 21:3). obeyeth the voice of his servant, Isa. 50:10. my servant shall deal prudently, Isa. 52:13. shall my righteous servant justify many, Isa. 53:11 (Mosiah 14:11). heritage of the servants of the Lord, Isa. 54:17 (3 Ne. 22:17). Daniel, servant of the living God, Dan. 6:20. he revealeth his secret unto his servants the prophets, Amos 3:7. I will bring forth my servant the Branch, Zech. 3:8.",
